<title>FRANCE: Renault VI 1996 loss 791 mln FF.</title>
<headline>Renault VI 1996 loss 791 mln FF.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net				    loss    791  vs  profit   712</p>
<p>    Operating			    loss    672  vs  profit 1,009</p>
<p>    Pre-tax				loss    764  vs  profit   955</p>
<p>    Financial debt			     4,636  vs	   3,123</p>
<p>    Cashflow					 213  vs	   1,679</p>
<p>    Turnover				    30,500  vs	  33,522</p>
<p>NOTE - Renault Vehicules Industriels, a subsidiary of Renault SA, issued its results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
